the failed multi-entry BTBs: there is no\\nindexed array, direction counter, unconditional-control decode, JALR path, or\\n32-bit predicted-next-PC pipeline payload.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 2, \"confidence\": \"low\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Add only a predicted-taken bit to the IF/ID and ID/EX payloads, avoiding a wide predicted-target metadata path.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Implement the one-entry full-tag conditional loop target buffer, predict only on exact hits, and update or invalidate it from resolved conditional branches with recovery and bus-stall priority.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Latch the one-bit prediction marker with its instruction and clear it on existing flush paths.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Train the entry from resolved conditional branches and generate recovery only when actual direction disagrees with the carried prediction, preserving misalignment traps and architectural pc_wdata.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Treat EX branch-prediction recovery as the existing redirect flush while preserving load, divide, and memory-backpressure priorities.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/zcore.sv\", \"description\": \"Connect conditional-branch training and misprediction recovery between EX and IF without changing the nret=1 top-level or RVFI retirement path.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_pipeline.py\", \"description\": \"Add repeated-loop warm-up, taken-hit, loop-exit invalidation, tag-miss, misaligned-target, and randomized bus-stall tests with exact ordered RVFI checks.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 2, \"confidence\": \"low\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Add only a predicted-taken bit to the IF/ID and ID/EX payloads, avoiding a wide predicted-target metadata path.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Implement t